Z||000000||FieroKyle||11-09-2001||09:14 PM||||Man, I just get out of work, and I go gas up my car for the weekend. I pull up next to ome kids I go to school with in a Cavilier. The one says, "so what kind of car is that?" "Buick Regal". "Whats it got in it?" "3.8 V-6", "thats a piece of ****  car with a 6." F- you. I tried to tell him with the turbo option is was the fastest production car in the world in the couple of years it was made (Grand National, Regal TT). Stupid, ignorant people. <P>Then I am pulling out, I see some kids I hate from school. Well I don't say anything and the one walks up to my car, spits on it, asks to fight (while he is holding a Busch), and calls my car **** . I swing open the door and whack him in legs, just pull my arm back about ready to punch him to kick his ass, but I didn't. There were people in their cars all staring around. (this was in Miejer parking lot, just after I got out of the Miejer gas station!) I got in my car drove off. He ended up throwing my Pop out the window. Man I was pissed. (Just 2 weeks ago he smashed his T-Bird up (80's) and got 6 points on his lisence for racing. He can't even drive).<P>At times like this wish I had the Fiero. Coulda have half the trouble since thats the only thing they all came up with is saying my winter beater is crap. I am like so what, thats what its supposed to do. I own two cars on my own, and these jokers are driving Caviliers and laughing at me. I don't get it<P>"Oh your car is **** " (The buick and Fiero) I am sick of it.<BR>I hate assholes.<BR>Sorry for the swears Cliff, but sometimes its needed.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0PgAgVMwT!1W9RUb20vChbvv6QaE!2K1LWrFB6SxTnTchZgvIygv7Y3YwXpVdD8GeNkWpurYfoQxvNRK6j6kEmOFLoIHavbIr/Kyle-85-GT.jpg">     <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>Kyle - 85' GT<p>[This message has been edited by FieroKyle (edited 11-10-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroMontreal||11-09-2001||09:18 PM||||I couldn't agree with you more! People are asses!||||reg||1
Z||000002||Spektrum-87GT||11-09-2001||10:16 PM||||welcome to the world of teenagers that think they know anything and everything about cars. I was there once, kinda still am  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I'll never forget some guy telling me about some trans am that 'accidentally' downshifted to 1st gear going 90mph. I actually believed him, the guy was stupid, i was even stupider for believing him. Dont let people get to you. A lot are ignorant, thick headed, and believe what they want to believe, whether its fact, fiction, or their opinion.<P>but... are you talking about the grand national? maybe for its time... but not the fastest production vehicle ever!<P>it sounds like you go to school with some real dopes, just ignore them, i went to school with a LOT of them too(dopes). Just dont let them get to you<P>------------------<BR>restoration/modification on hold until who knows when<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/spektrum_87gt/" TARGET=_blank>87 Fiero GT</A><BR>1991 Jeep Cherokee<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://members.home.com/bspracklin1/sig2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||isthiswhereiputausername?||11-09-2001||10:58 PM||||I think we all put up with morons like that in school,<P>Just last week I saw a guy I went to school with, he was always picking on the younger kids and getting in trouble.. he thought he was so much better then everyone, (he got on my bad side when he picked on a friend of mine a year younger and a lot smaller then him)<P><BR>Guess where I saw him??  Working at Wendys flipping burgers!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P><BR>It gives you a warm feeling inside when you see someone who "thought" he was so much better then everyone else (including me) working at a place earning about 1/4 of what I earn at my job  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P><BR>Hold in there Kyle, keep the stiff upper lip.. You will run into them again someday under different circumstances  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>||||reg||1
