Z||000020||ejayerik||12-18-2001||03:52 PM||||I hate people like that. The best way I have dealt with it was to laugh at them and ask "how old are you?" I have a brown belt in AIKIDO so fighting would not be good on their behalf. Just remember that one day they will get theirs. What goes around comes around. And you've got to wonder what gets them to be so ignorant. Was it from up-bringing? Or is it that they were abused? Don't be like them and let ego take over. Ego is the destroyer of mankind. Oh BTW, here is a pic of my other car..a Cavalier Z24.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0OQAAALYUBEiNYkTN2geiIrwfjv8F9W2oZcEgR*pjBNYQ84wTCkZ">   <P>[This message has been edited by ejayerik (edited 12-18-2001).]I can never get the pics to stick!!<p>[This message has been edited by ejayerik (edited 12-18-2001).]||||reg||1
